:: Burnout
# Burnout

You have pushed yourself too hard for too long.

You stop sleeping. You stop eating properly. You stop showing up.

By the time anyone notices, it is too late to catch up. You do not finish the year.

Rest is not weakness. It is the foundation everything else is built on.

[[Play Again->Start]]

:: Expelled
# Expelled

The school administration has reviewed the evidence. The decision is final.

You are expelled from school.

Without a diploma, your university dreams are over — at least for now.

Integrity, once lost, is hard to rebuild. But it is never too late to start.

[[Play Again->Start]]

