# Senior Year

Welcome to the most important year of your life — or so everyone keeps telling you.

You are a student entering Grade 12. Your goals are simple:

Graduate with a high GPA and get into a top university.

There is one catch. A tool called Cognito — an AI that can do your homework for you — is spreading through your school. It is tempting. It is everywhere. And every choice you make this year will shape your future.

